        "b": 339.25059539999995
      },
      "content": "If  the  fan  motor  starts  working  after  receiving  the  remote-control  order,  the  aion  generator  starts working and sends out ions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0136",
