        "t": 332.9455172,
        "r": 313.7162453600001,
        "b": 323.69273999999996
      },
      "content": "The ion generator stops as the fan motor stops."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0137",
      "reading_order": 203,
      "section": "5.1.3.3 Air cleaning",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.77251000000001,
        "t": 317.38766179999993,
        "r": 550.6417178499979,
        "b": 292.57702919999997
      },
      "content": "When the ion generator is OFF and the air cleaning function is on, the fan motor starts running and the ion generator starts working again."
    },
