      "content": "In timing mode, the display panel will flash the light at fixed times"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0017",
      "reading_order": 208,
      "section": "5.1.3.4 Timed running",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 98.98486901340739,
        "t": 211.60565185546875,
        "r": 553.9771898746491,
        "b": 87.2540283203125
      },
      "markdown": "| Timed OFF    | When this function is set, operation modes on the panel display will not change. The timing icon will show and the operation stops when the set time comes.   |\n|--------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Timed ON     | When this function is on, the panel display will only display a question mark. The unit will operate as the set mode when the time comes.                     |\n| Timed ON/OFF | The unit will start operating or stop according to the order of your setting.                                                                                 |"
